<title>ANTIGUA: CRICKET-AMBROSE HITS 300 MARK AS SRI LANKA ALL OUT FOR 223.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AMBROSE HITS 300 MARK AS SRI LANKA ALL OUT FOR 223.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka, sent in to bat by the West Indies, were dismissed for 223 on the opening day of the first test on Friday. Curtly Ambrose took five wickets to bring his test career haul to 300.</p>
</text>
